WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We don't always
have time enough

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.635 line:92%
to cover all of the recent news,

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.638
so here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.075 size:75% position:38%
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:14.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Whoo! You guys,
things have been crazy!

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.852
First of all, no one works
in the White House anymore.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sean Spicer was out,
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:27.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Reince Priebus was out,
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:28.561 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Then to top it all off,

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
Scaramucci was out
after just ten days,

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:32.899 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.100 size:75% position:38% line:92%
But then I found out

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
Steve Bannon
was still working there,

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:39.072 line:92%
and I was like, "What...?"

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.473 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:44.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I found out
the Boy Scouts invited Trump

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
to give a speech,
and I was like,

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Ha-ha-ha! Why?!"

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he started talking
to these children

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
about a guy getting laid
on a yacht,

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"Ha-ha-ha! What?!"

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he had those kids
booing Obama,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.796 line:92%
and I was like, "Ha-ha. What?"

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:04.164 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.300
Then the people who made
"Game of Thrones" announced

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.703
they're working on another show
called "Confederate"

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:11.971 line:92%
that imagines if the South

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
had successfully seceded
from the union

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
and slavery
had never been abolished.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:20.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
I heard that and was like,
"What the [bleep]?"

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.216 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:29.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then Amazon announced
that they were also working on

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.157 line:92%
a show called "Black America"

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
that imagines
if newly freed slaves

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:34.961 line:92%
had formed their own nation,

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like, "What...
a new and interesting idea."

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then the best thing
in the world happened.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:47.707
During a hearing of the House
Financial Services Committee,

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.242 line:92%
Representative Maxine Waters

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:52.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
asked Treasury Secretary
Steve Mnuchin

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:56.616
why he hadn't responded to a
letter she had sent him. Watch.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Everything that you've done
for the community there.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:01:59.853 line:92%
-Thank you very much for that.

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.221 line:92%
I don't want to take my time --

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:03.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I also have appreciated
the opportunity...

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.057 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Reclaiming my time.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
...to meet with you
several times.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.228 size:75% position:38%
-Reclaiming my time.
Reclaiming my time.

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:11.197
-The time belongs to the
gentlelady from California.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:13.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
-With the House...
-Reclaiming my time.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
Reclaiming my time.
-With the Senate...

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Reclaiming my time.
-Okay.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:18.605 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Reclaiming my time.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:21.407 size:88% position:44%
-Mr. Chairman, I thought
when you read the rules,

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
you acknowledged that
I shouldn't be interrupted

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:27.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that I would have --
-Reclaiming my time.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.349 line:92%
What he failed to tell you

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:33.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
was when you're on my time,
I can reclaim it.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:34.654 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:38.224 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoo! Whoo!

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.425 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I saw that and was like,

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:42.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What...better way
to shut a fool up."

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:46.032 size:88% position:44%
Then they voted against
the repeal of Obamacare,

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:47.667 line:92%
and I was like, "What-what!"

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.868 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Then everyone was like,

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
"John McCain voted no!
He saved us!"

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:52.705 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I was like,

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:56.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What...about Susan Collins
and Lisa Murkowski?"

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.279 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:02.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
And yesterday, I read
that the Justice Department

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:06.319
is investigating affirmative
action in college admissions,

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like, "Good! We need
more affirmative action."

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then I found out
that the Trump administration

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:16.429
is going to use resources
allocated for civil rights

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:17.664 size:84% position:42% line:92%
to investigate colleges

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:20.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
for discriminating
against white people.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:26.239
Then I said, "What?" so fast,
it broke the sound barrier.

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.007 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was like this.

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:29.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What?!

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:32.879 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:35.014 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That worked well.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:38.484
But, hey, I'm all for white
people getting an education.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:41.487
Then there won't be so many
people voting for Trump.

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.756 line:92%
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:45.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ladies and gentlemen,
give it up for Amber Ruffin.

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.296 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Reclaiming my time!

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.865 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Reclaiming my time.

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:55.401 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Reclaiming my time.

00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:57.403 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:59.639 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

